{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 2, "ref": "1-kings 21:2", "book": "1-kings", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 21, "translation": "Lalu Ahab berkata kepada Navot: \"Berkatalah kepadaku ⟨את⟩ kebun anggur itu, supaya ia menjadi kebun sayur bagiku, kerana ia berhampiran dengan rumahku; dan aku akan memberikan kepadamu sebagai gantinya kebun anggur yang lebih baik daripadanya; jika baik di mata engkau, aku akan memberikan kepadamu wang perak segala harganya.\"", "tokens": [{"surface": "וידבר", "gloss": "Lalu berkata"}, {"surface": "אחאב", "gloss": "Ahab"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "kepada"}, {"surface": "נבות", "gloss": "Navot"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "katanya"}, {"surface": "תנה", "gloss": "Berkatalah"}, {"surface": "לי", "gloss": "kepadaku"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "kebun anggur itu"}, {"surface": "כרמך", "gloss": "kebun anggurmu"}, {"surface": "ויהי", "gloss": "supaya ia menjadi"}, {"surface": "לי", "gloss": "bagiku"}, {"surface": "לגן", "gloss": "kebun"}, {"surface": "ירק", "gloss": "sayur"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "kerana"}, {"surface": "הוא", "gloss": "ia"}, {"surface": "קרוב", "gloss": "berhampiran"}, {"surface": "אצל", "gloss": "dengan"}, {"surface": "ביתי", "gloss": "rumahku"}, {"surface": "ואתנה", "gloss": "dan aku akan memberikan"}, {"surface": "לך", "gloss": "kepadamu"}, {"surface": "תחתיו", "gloss": "sebagai gantinya"}, {"surface": "כרם", "gloss": "kebun anggur"}, {"surface": "טוב", "gloss": "yang lebih baik"}, {"surface": "ממנו", "gloss": "daripadanya"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "jika"}, {"surface": "טוב", "gloss": "baik"}, {"surface": "בעיניך", "gloss": "di mata engkau"}, {"surface": "אתנה", "gloss": "aku akan memberikan"}, {"surface": "לך", "gloss": "kepadamu"}, {"surface": "כסף", "gloss": "wang perak"}, {"surface": "מחיר", "gloss": "harga"}, {"surface": "זה", "gloss": "ini"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T12:42:41.896713514Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}